2. A minimum donation/tip to the project (see FUNDING.yml)

Commercial License Fees (Suggested):

- Small Studio (< $1M revenue): $5,000 one-time OR 2% royalty
- Medium Studio ($1M-$10M): $25,000 one-time OR 3% royalty
- Large Studio (> $10M): $100,000 one-time OR 5% royalty
- Enterprise: Contact for custom terms

